Related code and data
---------------------
s1-reader and burst_db (https://github.com/opera-adt/s1-reader,
https://github.com/opera-adt/burst_db), Copyright (c) California Institute
of Technology, Apache License 2.0. sm_db follows their conventions (burst-ID
phase origin, EPSG choice, bounding-box snapping) and mirrors a few s1reader
orbit constants as literals; no code is copied from them.

Sentinel-1 data
    Granule metadata from the Alaska Satellite Facility (ASF) and precise
    orbit files are Copernicus Sentinel data, European Space Agency (ESA).

MapLibre GL JS (viewer)
    Loaded at view time from a CDN (BSD-3-Clause); not distributed here.
